<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[116, 782, 896, 869]]<|/det|>
[604] General procedure for \(^{225}\mathrm{Ac}\) - labeling \([^{225}\mathrm{Ac}]\mathrm{Ac}(\mathrm{NO}_3)_3\) in \(1\mathrm{mM}\) HCl (100 \(\mu \mathrm{Cl}\) ) is added to a mixture of a DOTA- cyclic peptide construct (4 nmol) in NaOAc buffer (0.4 M, pH 5.5- 6.5, total volume \(150~\mu \mathrm{L}\) ) in a \(1.8\mathrm{mL}\) Eppendorf tube. The resulting mixture is heated at \(80 - 100~^\circ \mathrm{C}\) in a thermal mixer at a shaking speed of \(500\mathrm{rpm}\) for \(15 - 30\mathrm{min}\) . Radiochemical purity is determined by iTLC.  

